Perfect! ✅ All TypeScript errors in the plugin have been fixed. Here's a summary of the changes:

## Fixed TypeScript Errors in `custom-endpoints.plugin.ts`

### Changes Made:

**1. Added proper typing for hook handlers (Lines 92-101)**
```typescript
// Before: No type annotations
matcher: (ctx) => ctx.path === "/get-session",

// After: Added `any` type for Better Auth context
matcher: (ctx: any) => ctx.path === "/get-session",
```

**2. Fixed the custom-sign-up endpoint path (Line 209)**
```typescript
// Before (incorrect path)
matcher: (ctx) => ctx.path === "/register" && ctx.method === "POST",

// After (correct path)
matcher: (ctx: any) => ctx.path === "/custom-sign-up" && ctx.method === "POST",
```

**3. Improved error handling with proper typing (Multiple locations)**
```typescript
// Before: error caught without type
catch (error) {

// After: Properly typed as unknown
catch (error: unknown) {
  // Then safely check:
  error instanceof Error ? error.message : "..."
}
```

**4. Fixed optional property access (Line 153)**
